### Create Payment - Success (with sufficient balance)
### Should return 201 CREATED
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/payment/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "CH9300762011623852957",
  "toAccount": "CH1234567890123456789",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "CHF",
  "reference": "Test payment - successful",
  "status": "PENDING"
}

###

### Create Payment - Success (with sufficient balance - EUR account)
### Should return 201 CREATED
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/payment/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "FR1420041010050500013",
  "toAccount": "FR7630006000011234567890189",
  "amount": 500.50,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "reference": "Test payment EUR - successful",
  "status": "PENDING"
}

###

### Create Payment - Failure (insufficient balance)
### Should return 201 initially, but payment will fail in processor
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/payment/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "payment-003",
  "fromAccount": "CH9300762011623852957",
  "toAccount": "CH1234567890123456789",
  "amount": 5000.00,
  "currency": "CHF",
  "reference": "Test payment - insufficient balance",
  "status": "PENDING"
}

