### Cancel Payment - Success (cancel payment-006)
### Should return 200 OK
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/payment/cancel?id=56b433c3-0451-40fd-90be-665c23fc05d5

###

### Cancel Payment - Failure (payment not found)
### Should return 200 initially, but will fail in processor
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/payment/cancel?id=56b433c3-0451-40fd-90be-665c23fc05d5